Title: Judge's Crossword Puzzle No. 151
Author: Catherine MacMillan
Date: 1930-04-12
Byline: Submitted by Catherine MacMillan, Chicago, Ill.
Source: https://archive.org/details/sim_judge_1930-04-12_98/page/n31/mode/1up
Number: 151
Solution-Source: https://archive.org/details/sim_judge_1930-04-19_98/page/n32/mode/1up


